{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50401","headline":"十三 · 王梵志","name":"十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尊人嗔约束，共语莫江降。\n（「江降」，伯三七一六卷作「江绦」，伯三六五六卷作「{马工}{马降}」，张锡厚疑应作「𤢐𤝷\n）纵有些些理，无烦说矩（郑校本云似应作短长。\n〖「矩长」，伯三七一六卷作「短长」。\n〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}